{{Quote|Fine. So what do you want, Ochi of&hellip; Bestoon. What exactly is a 'Bestoon'? Is that a planet or a&hellip; clan? Species?|[[Enric Pryde]], to Ochi of Bestoon|<ref name="Shadow of the Sith">''[[Shadow of the Sith]]''</ref>}}
The '''Bestoonian''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]]. One Bestoonian was the [[Sith assassin]] [[Ochi]],<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> who hailed from the [[planet]]<ref name="Final Order">{{EncyclopediaCite|The Final Order and the Battle of Exegol}}</ref> [[Bestoon]].<ref name="Encyclopedia" />

